        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In DSC #18: The Data-Sitteres' HathiTrust Mistake, Cadence Cordell and Quinn Dombrowski try to use the HathiTrust Data Capsule with advice from Glen Layne-Worthey, and the experience is not unlike when the Baby-Sitters go to visit New York City.",
